{
  "_comment": "EXAMPLE ONLY - not tested against a live ComfyUI in this repo. Core-node text-to-image graph in API format. Change ckpt_name to a checkpoint you have in ComfyUI/models/checkpoints, then copy to config/workflows/image_workflow_api.json. Remove this _comment key if your ComfyUI version rejects unknown keys.",
